# Auto-generated tooling index, machine-specific
.atl/

# Editor local history (VS Code Local History extension)
.history/

# CodeGraph index — per-checkout, never shared
.codegraph/

# Claude Code local state: `settings.local.json` (this machine's permissions)
# and `worktrees/` (throwaway checkouts agents branch into). Both are
# per-machine and neither belongs to anyone else.
#
# Note for later: project-level Claude config meant to be SHARED — a
# `settings.json`, a `skills/` or `agents/` directory — would be swallowed by
# this rule without warning. Adding one means un-ignoring it explicitly
# (`!.claude/settings.json`), not deleting the line.
.claude/

# Sealed contract PDFs. `ALMACEN_DOCUMENTOS_RUTA` defaults to `var/documentos`
# (apps/api/src/config/configuracion.ts), relative to wherever the API runs —
# so signing anything locally, and running the integration suite, writes real
# PDFs here. Each one carries a customer's name, DNI and signature image.
#
# Committing one would put personal data into version control permanently,
# where deleting the file does not remove it from history. This is Ley 25.326
# data, and the repository is the one place it must never reach.
var/

